-name: implement-astra-reviewed-2-2
-description: "Execute complex implementation with Sol 6.1/xhigh authorship and independent Astra/high review, using large cohesive batches, selective architecture gates, phase-local progress and review evidence, isolated concurrent workstreams, and context continuity. Use when an implementation request selects this workflow; not for standalone planning or review."
